e("Taika and the 119 Outworlders",["119 outworlders","outworlders arrive","Taika outworlder","Earth refugees","Dolores"],
"""119 humans from Earth (bronze/silver, heavy core users) appear naked and hairless in the craters of a destroyed Purity ritual valley; all ask for Jason Asano. Taika Williams (Māori; Aussie high-voice) is one of them and says he and Travis came through after the Earth rift expanded; Danielle Geller takes them to the Geller estate (later Cyrion). Taika knows the team from Jason's 'holiday videos'. In Book 12 about 74 of them return to Earth.""",7),
e("Melody Jain and the Order of Redeeming Light",["Melody Jain","Order of Redeeming Light","Redeemed Core","Purity enclave","Sendira","Laront"],
"""Melody Jain: dark-skinned, white-haired silver-ranker leader of an Order of Redeeming Light (Purity) enclave, Sophie's mother; faked her death 20 years earlier; Purity offers a Redeemed Core (lose powers, gain an entire rank, gold from silver; total faith required or become mindless). She wants Jason alive to lure her daughter. She is brainwashed by Purity/Builder magic and later treated by Carlos in Book 12. Marta Fries (celestine) was her friend. Second Sendira; priest Laront.""",7),
